WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.435 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, here's what
people are talking about.

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:03.269 line:92%
A huge, huge political story.

00:00:03.269 --> 00:00:05.372
Last night, Doug Jones
pulled off a shocking win

00:00:05.372 --> 00:00:09.109 align:start size:94% position:6%
over Roy Moore to become
Senator of Alabama.

00:00:09.109 --> 00:00:12.078 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:13.079 --> 00:00:16.082
And you know it's been a crazy
year when an alleged pedophile

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:18.018 align:start size:94% position:6%
loses a Senate race,
and we're like,

00:00:18.018 --> 00:00:20.053 size:75% position:38% line:92%
"Wow. What an upset!

00:00:20.053 --> 00:00:23.556 align:start size:94% position:6%
I thought the pedophile
was gonna win!"

00:00:23.556 --> 00:00:24.591 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
What?

00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:26.426 size:78% position:39%
Yep, Roy Moore became
the first Republican

00:00:26.426 --> 00:00:30.096 align:start size:94% position:6%
to lose an Alabama Senate race
in 25 years.

00:00:30.096 --> 00:00:36.036
It was so embarrassing,
his horse went home in an Uber.

00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:39.339 line:92%
"You Sassy the horse? Get in.

00:00:39.339 --> 00:00:41.374 line:92%
What kind of music you like?"

00:00:41.374 --> 00:00:44.244
As the results came in,
reporters said it was very quiet

00:00:44.244 --> 00:00:45.745 align:start size:94% position:6%
at Moore's campaign
headquarters.

00:00:45.745 --> 00:00:49.182 align:start size:94% position:6%
But to be fair,
it was a school night, so...

00:00:49.182 --> 00:00:53.953 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-Hey-oh! Ho. Ho. Ho!

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:56.289 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But you could tell things
weren't going well.

00:00:56.289 --> 00:00:59.592
One of Moore's spokesmen went
on CNN to defend his belief

00:00:59.592 --> 00:01:02.062 align:start size:94% position:6%
