can't run for office.

00:01:02.062 --> 00:01:04.164 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he got some
surprising information.

00:01:04.164 --> 00:01:04.831 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Watch his reaction.

00:01:04.831 --> 00:01:07.434
-You don't actually have to
swear on a Christian Bible.

00:01:07.434 --> 00:01:09.135 align:start size:94% position:6%
You can swear on
anything, really.

00:01:09.135 --> 00:01:11.538
I don't know if you knew that.
You can swear on a Jewish Bible.

00:01:11.538 --> 00:01:14.274 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, no. I swore on the Bible.
I've done it three times.

00:01:14.274 --> 00:01:16.409
-I'm sure you have.
I'm sure you've picked a Bible.

00:01:16.409 --> 00:01:20.113
But the law is not that you have
to swear on a Christian Bible.

00:01:20.113 --> 00:01:22.649 size:75% position:38% line:92%
That is not the law.

00:01:24.317 --> 00:01:26.419 size:75% position:38% line:92%
You don't know that?

00:01:26.419 --> 00:01:28.555 line:92%
All right. Ted Crockett...

00:01:28.555 --> 00:01:31.658 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.327 --> 00:01:37.397 line:92%
-Blink twice for yes, Ted.

00:01:39.966 --> 00:01:40.867 line:92%
He looks like he just found out

00:01:40.867 --> 00:01:43.036
he's been saying his wife's name
wrong for 20 years.

00:01:43.036 --> 00:01:47.674 align:start size:94% position:6%
