00:01:53.279 --> 00:01:55.849
and made some pretty interesting
remarks about him.

00:01:55.849 --> 00:01:56.583 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Listen to this.

00:01:56.583 --> 00:01:59.018
-This guy does not belong
on the national stage.

00:01:59.018 --> 00:02:00.954 align:start size:94% position:6%
He looks like
some disheveled drunk

00:02:00.954 --> 00:02:02.689 align:start size:94% position:6%
