the political stage.

00:02:02.689 --> 00:02:05.825
-Did you just call Steve Bannon
a disheveled drunk?

00:02:05.825 --> 00:02:09.229
-No, to be very precise,
I said he looks like one.

00:02:09.229 --> 00:02:11.798 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.266 --> 00:02:14.834 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Wait.

00:02:14.834 --> 00:02:15.735 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.735 --> 00:02:19.072 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"I'm not saying he's ugly.
I'm just saying he looks ugly.

00:02:19.072 --> 00:02:19.973 size:81% position:41% line:92%
That's all I'm saying.

00:02:19.973 --> 00:02:23.743 align:start size:94% position:6%
